      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNGLE JOHNNY (8) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a nose win at this track in a handy 29.57. Outside box to overcome but goes well over this trip. The hardest to beat again. REBORN HOSTILITY (1) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, winding up to score two back then finishing on strongly last time when second (29.58) in a NG at this track. Has a good record here including 10 wins. Can measure up. BANDIT LYNNE (2) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (29.61) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can feature again. GALBA MODEL (7) comes off a (29.65) win last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in a NG over 520m at this track. Has already won one times from this draw.",
